// The skill (M2 O3): a coiled drop with the blade held low behind, then a whole turn with the arm out,
// which cuts on ticks 12 to 15, and a rising cut coming out of the turn on ticks 21 to 25, off the
// ground at its top. A flick of the blade ends it. A key names at most a little over a quarter turn of
// root, since bones blend the short way.
//
// Turns are degrees in the character's rest space, about each bone's own joint, X then Y then Z.
// The character faces +Z, with its left arm along +X at rest. Ticks are 60 a second. `root` is where
// the move has carried the character, `hips` moves the hips from rest. The right hand holds a blade,
// leaving the fist on the thumb side, though none is drawn yet. Frame data is in player.moves.ron.
